<title>SWEDEN: Swedish car registrations up 18.3 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Swedish car registrations up 18.3 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish car registrations rose by 18.3 percent to 13,341 cars in August compared to the same month in 1995, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
<p>An increase of 20.1 percent to 1,479 was noted for lorries in August, up from 1,231 last year.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46 8 700-1017</p>
</text>
